#: ../../library/omv.ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.rst:21
#: ../../library/omv.ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.rst:45
msgid "``threshold`` Score threshold for filtering detections before NMS."
msgstr "``threshold`` 在 NMS 之前用于过滤检测结果的分数阈值。"

#: ../../library/omv.ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.rst:23
#: ../../library/omv.ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.rst:47
msgid ""
"``nms_threshold`` IoU threshold used by NMS to suppress overlapping bounding"
" boxes."
msgstr "``nms_threshold`` NMS 用于抑制重叠边界框的 IoU 阈值。"

#: ../../library/omv.ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.rst:25
#: ../../library/omv.ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.rst:49
msgid "``nms_sigma`` Sigma value used by Soft-NMS for score decay."
msgstr "``nms_sigma`` Soft-NMS 用于分数衰减的 Sigma 值。"

#: ../../library/omv.ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.rst:29
#: ../../library/omv.ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.rst:53
msgid ""
"Post-process the ``outputs`` list of arrays produced by ``model`` for the "
"given ``inputs`` list. Returns a list of per-class lists; each inner list "
"contains ``((x, y, w, h), score)`` tuples in ROI coordinates. Empty class "
"lists are preserved so each list index matches the corresponding class index"
" in the model output."
msgstr ""
"对 ``model`` 针对给定 ``inputs`` 列表所产生的 ``outputs`` "
"数组列表进行后处理。返回一个按类别分组的列表的列表；每个内层列表包含以 ROI 坐标表示的 ``((x, y, w, h), score)`` "
"元组。空的类别列表会被保留，以使每个列表索引与模型输出中对应的类别索引相匹配。"

